      "content": "Pivoting to \"system optimization\" or \"metadata discrepancies\" is a significant risk that can be easily disproven and may appear manipulative to the public and the press.\n\nThese carefully chosen, deliberately vague terms often raise more suspicion than a direct admission of the control failure would, potentially looking like an attempt to deceive rather than manage an incident.\n\nFor your long-term trust, it is better to acknowledge the control oversight factually and then immediately pivot to the proactive steps you are taking to make the system more secure for the future.",
